  "id": "section-839",
  "title": "对陈伯达同志《两个月来运动的总结》的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-219.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>219)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　直送伯达同志，改稿看过，很好。抓革命、促生产这两句话是否在什么地方加进去，请考虑。要大量印成小册子，每个支部、每个红卫兵小队起码有一份。<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-218.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-220.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
